The following is allowed without asking:

- Modpacks: You may include the mod in modpacks, as long as the modpack
  downloads the mod from the official project pages (CurseForge or GitHub)
  and does not contain the mod's jar file itself.
- Config files and resource packs: You may share your own settings files
  (config/worldmapplus.properties) and add translations with your own resource
  packs, and you may share these packs. They must not contain the mod's code.
- Building for personal use: You may build the mod from the source code for
  your own use. You may not publish the result.

To ask for permission, contact the author through the project page on
CurseForge or the issue tracker on GitHub.
